Yes — since your enterprise data is in Iceberg tables / data warehouse, I would not use Iceberg directly for low-latency app serving.

Use an additional Serving / Operational Database layer.

Recommended database layer

Best choice for Azure shop: Azure PostgreSQL Flexible Server

Use it for:

Application transactional data
User/session/conversation state
Low-latency API reads/writes
Cached/curated AI insights
Report-ready summary tables
Metadata and workflow status
